@supabaseUrl = https://ivigodambfrohoncepou.supabase.co
@key = sb_publishable_RTwWiKfGtwqpqCBKJCLRhQ_BJTytxIL

### RLS-test 1: Anonym läsning av properties ska FUNGERA (select-policy: using true)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/properties?select=property_id,title
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### RLS-test 2: Anonym läsning av bookings ska ge TOM lista [] (policyn kräver authenticated)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?select=*
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### RLS-test 3: Anonym INSERT ska NEKAS (401/403, felkod 42501)
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/properties
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "5db14e43-c106-46c3-aaae-d0aed5bcc056",
  "title": "Hackat boende",
  "description": "Ska inte gå",
  "city": "Test",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 100,
  "max_guests": 1,
  "kind": "cabin"
}

### RLS-test 4: Anonym DELETE ska inte radera något (tom lista tillbaka, eller nekas)
DELETE {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/properties?property_id=eq.a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Prefer: return=representation

### Root
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get all properties
GET http://localhost:3000/properties

### Get property by id
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get property by invalid uuid
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/not-a-valid-uuid

### Create property
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Small studio in Malmö",
  "description": "A compact studio close to cafés and the central station.",
  "city": "Malmö",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 990,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688"
}

### Create invalid property
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Missing valid title and invalid price.",
  "city": "Malmö",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 0,
  "max_guests": 2
}

### Update property
PUT http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated apartment in Stockholm",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1390,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267"
}

### Delete property
DELETE http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### Public route
GET http://localhost:3000/properties

### Protected route
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Logged in user apartment",
  "description": "A property created through a protected route.",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1200,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267"
}
